[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_01]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_01_desc]
More farms means more muffins, it’s a very simple logic.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_01_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about farm construction, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_01]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_01_desc]
更多的农场，就意味着更多的马芬，非常简单的道理。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_01_TOOLTIP]
